# 📱 S3 Mobile Upload

A simple and secure file-upload system that allows a web/mobile client to upload files directly to Amazon S3 using pre-signed URLs.

The Flask backend generates a temporary S3 pre-signed URL, and the client uses that URL to upload the file directly to Amazon S3.

## 🏗️ Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[📱 Web / Mobile Client] -->|1. Request Upload URL| B[🐍 Flask API :5050]
    B -->|2. Generate Pre-Signed URL| A
    A -->|3. Direct HTTP PUT Upload| C[☁️ Amazon S3]
    C -->|4. Upload Complete| A
